import {Download,Info,TrendingUp,Wallet} from 'lucide-react';import {Button,Card,PageHeader} from '../components/ui/Kit';import {MonthlySalesChart,ProductBarChart,ExpenseDonut} from '../components/charts/Charts';import {useMetrics,useStore} from '../context/Store';import {downloadCSV,money,pct} from '../lib/format';
export default function Reports(){const {state}=useStore();const m=useMetrics();const gross=m.revenue-m.cost;return <><PageHeader eyebrow="Entèlijans biznis" title="Rapò & analiz" description="Konprann chif ou yo pou ou ka pran pi bon desizyon." action={<Button variant="outline" onClick={()=>downloadCSV('tikes-rapo.csv',[['Endikatè','Valè'],['Lavant',m.revenue],['Pri machandiz ki vann',m.cost],['Lòt depans biznis',m.businessExpenses],['Benefis estime',m.profit],['Dèt kliyan',m.receivables],['Dèt founisè',m.payables]])}><Download size={16}/> Telechaje rapò</Button>}/><div className="mb-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><Card><p className="kicker">Lavant total</p><p className="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold">{money(m.revenue,state.currency)}</p></Card><Card><p className="kicker">Marge brit estime</p><p className="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold">{pct(gross,m.revenue)}%</p></Card><Card><p className="kicker">Pri pwodwi vann</p><p className="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold">{money(m.cost,state.currency)}</p></Card><Card><p className="kicker">Benefis estime</p><p className={`mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold ${m.profit<0?'text-red-600':'text-forest'}`}>{money(m.profit,state.currency)}</p></Card></div><div className="grid gap-5 xl:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr]"><Card><h3 className="mb-4 font-display text-lg font-extrabold">Lavant sou 6 dènye mwa yo</h3><MonthlySalesChart/></Card><Card><h3 className="mb-4 font-display text-lg font-extrabold">Pi gwo kontribitè nan lavant</h3><ProductBarChart/></Card><Card><h3 className="font-display text-lg font-extrabold">Kote depans biznis yo ale</h3><ExpenseDonut/></Card><Card><h3 className="font-display text-lg font-extrabold">Rezime finans biznis</h3><div className="mt-5 space-y-4">{[['Lavant',m.revenue],['− Pri achte pwodwi vann',-m.cost],['− Lòt depans biznis',-m.businessExpenses]].map(([label,value])=><div key={label} className="flex justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 text-sm"><span className="text-slate-600">{label}</span><strong>{money(Number(value),state.currency)}</strong></div>)}<div className="flex justify-between rounded-xl bg-mint p-4"><strong>Benefis estime</strong><strong className="text-forest">{money(m.profit,state.currency)}</strong></div></div><div className="mt-5 flex gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f7f3] p-3 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500"><Info size={17} className="shrink-0"/>Sa se yon estimasyon ki baze sou tranzaksyon ou anrejistre yo. Li pa yon deklarasyon kontab ofisyèl.</div></Card></div><div className="mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#e9f4ee] p-5 text-sm text-forest"><div className="flex gap-3"><TrendingUp className="shrink-0"/><div><strong>Ti konsèy TIKÈS</strong><p className="mt-1">Kontinye anrejistre chak lavant ak depans pou rapò ou yo rete itil. Pri pwodwi yo se yon pati enpòtan nan kalkil benefis la.</p></div><Wallet className="ml-auto shrink-0 opacity-40"/></div></div></>}
